# Force LF line endings on every checkout (all platforms).
#
# Why: several static-contract tests grep source files for newline-
# sensitive patterns (e.g. "\n    }\n" function-body extraction). A
# Windows checkout with autocrlf would hand them CRLF and fail every
# such test. Normalizing to LF keeps the suite deterministic on
# ubuntu/macos/windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
